How the strategies were tested
──────────────────────────────
  Assets      US Equity, Intl Equity, Bonds, Gold and Real Estate; T-Bills as
              cash. Monthly returns, Nov 1996 to Oct 2026.
  Validation  Holdout: fitted to the history to Oct 2016, scored on Nov 2016 to
              Oct 2026. Fixed weights, not fitted, are scored on the same
              periods.
  Limits      At most 60% in any asset; fully invested.
  Trading     Rebalanced quarterly, 10 bp trading costs.
  Ratios      Against the T-Bills return, 2.5% a year over the test; value at
              risk and expected shortfall from history, at 95% over one month.

